### Do the TSD RECEIVE:

```
INMR901I Dataset TCC021.CMC.LOADPDSE from TCC021 on N1
INMR902I Members: VUECERTS
INMR154I The incoming data set is a 'PROGRAM LIBRARY'.
INMR906A Enter restore parameters or 'DELETE' or 'END' +

 IEBCOPY MESSAGES AND CONTROL STATEMENTS                      PAGE     1
 IEB1135I IEBCOPY  FMID HDZ3310  SERVICE LEVEL UJ96518  DATED 20250108
 DFSMS 03.01.00 z/OS    03.01.00 HBB77E0  CPU 3932
 IEB1035I LBDYCK   TSOPROC  TSOPROC  07:37:24 FRI 12 DEC 2025 PARM=''
  COPY INDD=((SYS00124,R)),OUTDD=SYS00123
 IEB1013I COPYING FROM PDSU  INDD=SYS00124 VOL=WORK0B
 DSN=SYS25346.T073724.RA000.LBDYCK1.R0104983
 IEB1014I  TO PDSE OUTDD=SYS00123 VOL=CBTU02 DSN=LBDYCK1.CMC.LOADPDSE
 IGW01551I MEMBER VUECERTS HAS BEEN LOADED
 IGW01550I 1 OF 1  MEMBERS WERE LOADED
 IEB147I END OF JOB - 0 WAS HIGHEST SEVERITY CODE
 INMR001I Restore successful to dataset 'LBDYCK1.CMC.LOADPDSE'
 ```
